 s their land from invading British forces.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festiva
 l/ka-whawhai-tonu-struggle-without-end\n\nAlso playing:\n\n• Shoreline C
 C Theater (Sun 18 May\, 2:30 PM)\n\nFilm is also being streamed.
