UID:4mUVgMUvJE
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 84 mins (1h24m)\n\nWhen Angelo is accidentally separ
 ated from his family\, he turns his imagination up to 11 as he journeys th
 rough the dark woods to grandmother’s house\, encountering a wondrous fa
 iry tale fantasy world along the way in this eco-conscious marvel of a fam
 ily film. Ages 8+\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/into-the-wonderwoods\n\
 nAlso playing:\n\n• Shoreline CC Theater (Sun 18 May\, 12:00 PM)
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
