 o build the perfect man. SXSW NEON Auteur Award winner. Get in the right h
 eadspace for this absolute ride of a film with a trivia giveaway hosted by
  BoneBat Comedy of Horrors Film Fest before the May 23 screening.\n\nhttps
 ://www.siff.net/festival/dead-lover\n\nAlso playing:\n\n• AMC Pacific Pl
 ace 11 (Sat 24 May\, 1:45 PM)
